    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Maybe there's no choice to make anymore. In the old songs, when a commander fails this badly, they don't just go on to command another army. They find a way to settle the debt. They find a way to meet their men in the afterlife so they can finally ask for forgiveness. It seems like the only way to stop the noise in my head would be to find a way to join them. To make it right, once and for all.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
